ve information, decide the ownship action: Decelerate / Hold / Accelerate. \\n    Never include reasoning, explanations, or any text other than the single chosen action.\\n### User:\\nHere is the ownship state information:\\n    [v, v_min, v_max, d1, d2, delta_dwpt1, delta_dwpt2, delta_v1, delta_v2, same_route1, same_route2] = [13.38, 0.00, 30.87, nan, nan, nan, nan, nan, nan, nan, nan]. \\n    Based on the above information, what actions should the ownship take? (Decelerate/Hold/Accelerate). Always start your response with: The recommended action is: \\n### Assistant: ',\n",
